Subject: [PATCH 29/42] netplay: the HPS side of the wireless adapter's mailbox
 (rfu_mailbox.cpp)
---
 support/netplay/rfu_mailbox.cpp | 93 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 support/netplay/rfu_mailbox.h   | 36 +++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 129 insertions(+)
